    "rationale": "The true no-MTP AR denominator already uses a warmup decode. The native MTP category harness previously charged each prompt for the first MTP draft wrapper/library/weight-cache cold start (~99 ms), while warm draft rows are ~7 ms. A stateless warmup run does not mutate target/session state or consume output tokens, and exposes steady-state MTP tok/s without prompt/token-specific behavior.",
    "anti_gaming": "No prompt text, token IDs, candidate ranks, fixture IDs, target-token rescue branches, prompt-suite edits, accepted/output policy changes, or true-AR denominator changes."
